 "rule": "The case keys the school part of education_services on public K-12 pupils priced where they live (school_enrollment_2026_09_20): October 2024 CPS public K-12 rates by age band, with 3-4 and 25+ pooled, transported onto March 2025 CPS civilians and priced at the state's current spending per pupil (gen_ledger_extension_2026_09_16 state_parameters.csv). The rough engine keyed every group on persons aged 5-17, so the rough comparison dropped the case's school pricing on the lineage's side (the case-to-rough bridge carried it) and never priced it for the comparators. Here every record takes the rate of its own cell, fitted on the October records of the same cell: the Mexican-origin union (the case's own definition), NH Black alone, third-plus NH white alone (A1), other NH white alone, and everyone else. A member's child outside the group takes its own cell's rate. The national total is every civilian's exposure, so the cells' shares add to 1.",
